# THE DROP STRIKE (mechanics pass, slice 1b; FightSim.drop_strike). A jump that
# comes down a ledge onto a machine lands as a blow, and that one blow opens any
# plate: a harvester's working part is its guarded front, and here it is struck
# from BEHIND, off the lip, and hurt. From above, then over the shoulder. The
# ledge is the nearest drop `Jump.find` names and the machine is stood a reach
# past where that jump comes down (`under`), never a coordinate.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/drop_strike.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=knife:1 --held=knife
coast calm
zoom 7
wait 0.6
ledge down
wait 0.3
under harvester
wait 0.6
shot 01-a-harvester-waits-under-the-lip with mob:harvester
leap 0.12
await jumping 2
wait 0.12
shot 02-coming-down-on-its-back with jumping,mob:harvester
await hit 3
shot 03-the-landing-struck-through-its-plate with mob:harvester
wait 0.6
shot 04-down-among-it with mob:harvester

# Over the shoulder the view looks where the camera was left, so the machine is
# held with the lock (Z), as a player would frame it before stepping off; the
# body faces it and the leap goes that way.
coast calm
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
ledge down
wait 0.6
under harvester
wait 0.3
hold target
await target 5
await shoulder_locked 3
await lock_facing 3
wait 0.4
shot 05-over-the-shoulder-locked-on-it-below with shoulder_locked,mob:harvester
leap 0.12
await jumping 2
wait 0.12
shot 06-over-the-shoulder-coming-down with shoulder_locked,jumping,mob:harvester
await hit 3
shot 07-over-the-shoulder-the-landing-struck with shoulder_locked,mob:harvester
wait 0.6
shot 08-over-the-shoulder-after with mob:harvester
release target
